오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/681f2b65a02134ec12f4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37211-1-8-2","ko":"그러게 말이야. 장 보러 가기가 무서울 정도야.","zh":"是啊，简直怕得不敢去购物了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}},{"text":"장","meaning":"市场","explanation":"장：市场","readings":[{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73815","senseId":"2","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}},{"text":"보러","meaning":"买货","explanation":"보다：买货；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"11","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보러","audio":"/audio/d5e8ae6946132d84eb67.mp3"}},{"text":"가기가","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가기가","audio":"/audio/579f7e2fabc2c92e0385.mp3"}},{"text":"무서울","meaning":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","explanation":"무섭다：怕，害怕